name visualfaq
category Package
revision 61719
shortdesc A Visual LaTeX FAQ
longdesc Having trouble finding the answer to a LaTeX question? The
longdesc Visual LaTeX FAQ is an innovative new search interface that
longdesc presents over a hundred typeset samples of frequently requested
longdesc document formatting. Simply click on a hyperlinked piece of
longdesc text and the Visual LaTeX FAQ will send your Web browser to the
longdesc appropriate page in the TeX FAQ.
